WEBVTT

00:05.120 --> 00:06.880
Planning a commercial space? Stop

00:06.880 --> 00:08.919
and think. Before you decide how

00:08.919 --> 00:10.400
it should look, start with how

00:10.400 --> 00:12.399
your business actually works. That

00:12.399 --> 00:14.080
is the true foundation of every

00:14.080 --> 00:14.888
great design.

00:15.209 --> 00:17.528
Every business has unique needs.

00:17.528 --> 00:19.369
An office requires space for deep

00:19.369 --> 00:21.929
focus and collaboration. A shop

00:21.929 --> 00:24.289
needs clear browsing paths. A cafe

00:24.289 --> 00:25.969
needs a practical, efficient flow

00:25.969 --> 00:26.937
for your customers.

00:27.258 --> 00:28.537
A design team connects those

00:28.537 --> 00:30.178
specific needs with the physical

00:30.178 --> 00:31.898
space, budget and technical

00:31.898 --> 00:33.618
systems. We help important

00:33.618 --> 00:35.457
decisions happen early before the

00:35.457 --> 00:37.058
construction work even begins on

00:37.058 --> 00:37.810
your project.

00:37.811 --> 00:39.770
Before committing to any premises,

00:39.770 --> 00:41.171
check the layout, available

00:41.171 --> 00:43.251
services and landlord conditions.

00:43.251 --> 00:44.891
Confirm exactly which specialist

00:44.891 --> 00:46.091
reviews and permissions your

00:46.091 --> 00:48.131
project needs. It saves you time

00:48.131 --> 00:49.163
and major headaches.

00:49.444 --> 00:50.684
During the fit-out, keep

00:50.684 --> 00:52.924
responsibilities and changes clear.

00:52.924 --> 00:54.724
Before opening, allow sufficient

00:54.724 --> 00:56.563
time for testing, snagging, and

00:56.563 --> 00:58.644
final handover, as well as crucial

00:58.644 --> 01:00.444
business preparations to ensure you

01:00.444 --> 01:00.996
are ready.
